<heading>list - List all topics.</heading>

<rule/>

<heading level="2">
Usage
</heading>

<pre>
  list
</pre>

<heading level="2">
Description
</heading>

<paragraph>
Lists all topics of the ABC library with their ids and their
category, sorted alphabetically.
</paragraph>

<heading level="2">
See also
</heading>

<paragraph>
find, add
</paragraph>
